# Zenith architecture

Read **[`ARCHITECTURE.md`](../../ARCHITECTURE.md)** and **[`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)** before changing layers.

**Rule:** who decides ≠ who transmits ≠ who serializes.

- `Gameplay/` decides; `Protocol/` transmits; `Packets/` serialize only.
- Do **not** recreate `Network/` as a catch-all.
- Freeze unless ADR: Scheduler, Actor/ECS, VisibilitySystem, DI, plugin API, `/` command framework.
- Platform health (not H1 product): [`docs/robustness-dx-debt.md`](../../docs/robustness-dx-debt.md) §54.
